etItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2950410,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2950410","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:33:49Z","value":10,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4465780","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1846651706689928","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest is here! - Demo Patch #3","summary":"Last patch before the Steam Next Fest! Nothing major added since we're more looking at improving what's already there rather than shaking up the game in major ways. That's why this patch focuses more on quality of life changes and new content plus improvements on what was already there. After this, you can expect one more patch planned for the release of the game on November 6. For those new to the game or coming back, I added the two previous major patches we released down below. For Competitiv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:05:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1846651706688033","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Gear Up Einstein! – Demo Gameplay Broadcast","summary":"Next Fest Gameplay Replay Wondering what Gear Up Einstein! looks like in action? We're running a gameplay replay on our store page for all of Steam Next Fest. This is a pre-recorded broadcast, not a live stream. Try it yourself The free demo is available now during Next Fest. Grab a friend, gear up, and see how far your team can go in this co-op strategy roguelite. Coming to Early Access – November 6, 2026 Add Gear Up Einstein! to your wishlist so you don't miss the launch! Wishlist on Steam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:10:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688033","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1842846814446419","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Crossroad Update - Demo Patch #2","summary":"With this patch, we're bringing you the ability to choose your path and encounter random events through our new CROSSROAD feature. We also completely reworked the final invasion levels, changed the butterfly effects, created new agent traits, added achievements, and implemented quality of life features. Message from the developers As we approach Steam Next Fest and our Early Access launch, we've been looking into improving replayability even more, making each mission unique with its own twists a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T13:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446419","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1836506165565407","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v123.23","summary":"Changes Fixed a couple of bugs Fixed task force upgrades not applying anymore after divergence briefing Added Difficulty 3 to the demo Ajustment to balancing Text localization fixes Fixed some crashes n.b. no translations for this patch note since it's a smaller quick one","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T13:28:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565407","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1836506165547539","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #1: Divergence, Gadgets, Item Compare & Guides","summary":"In this patch, we are introducing the new Divergence system, a complete gadget rework, balancing adjustments, improved visuals, and a bunch of onboarding improvements. Message from the developers It's been great watching you play Gear Up Einstein since we released our first playable demo back in April. We're thrilled to see the positive response and glad to be overwhelmed with feedbacks. Keep it coming! After reading all your comments and reports, we've been hard at work making a bunch of adjust","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T01:30:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547539","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1832065502808901","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v118.6","summary":"Couple of small fixes:Improve \"Hold Click\" display on lobby upgradesfix recruitments sometime selecting the wrong characterfix character trait descriptions being readable when not yet unlockedn.b. no translations of this patch note since it's a smaller quick one","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-06T13:27:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502808901","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1830797770237546","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v118.4","summary":"We have fixed some issues in the demo. Here's the list: - Fix the invincibility effect that was not preventing debuffs like stun - Multiplayer fixes to prevent disconnection and errors - Spawn location of agents ajusted - New music! - Fix health bar overlapping with the reinforcements interface - Fix Einstein passive showing a wrong rounded number - Fix briefing not playing for some profiles - Fix error in baseball bat - Gear Ability and Energy are now explained in one single intel - Fix display","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T22:32:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770237546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1830163047261247","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release !","summary":"The Demo is live! Play right now, either solo or online with your friends. Here’s what’s available in this demo:12 historical figures to try!2 sci-fi gadgets2 skill tree with limited upgrades2 levels of difficulty to conquerWe want you feedback ! Here’s changes we made lately. If you have any comments on these make sure to submit it to us. 1. Meta progressionWe reworked the progression and now allow players to have their own permanent upgrades.Replaced the Portals we had in the previous playtest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T19:40:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261247","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1824644522845507","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest 3","summary":"Join the Playtest directly from the Steam page and invite friends to team up (up to 3 players).What’s new in Playtest 3:New Player Experience: Added a tutorial, multiple difficulty levels, tips, and upgrades to gradually ramp up complexity and help you learn the game.Visuals: Improvements across the board, especially to the interface and in-mission menus.Core Gameplay: Many new and reworked items. The mission flow has been fully rethought to encourage creativity and strategic mastery.Game-Twisti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-16T14:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522845507","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-1796631172414452","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2","summary":"FINALLY ! We've updated Gear Up Einstein! again after working hard for the last 8 months. Come play with your friends ! Join the playtest directly through the steam page Group up with other players and play as team of up to 3 players, or just try is solo ! We've made a lot of improvements to make the game challenging, replayable and reliant on cooperation. Let us know what you think!Submit feedback and bug reports directly in-game. You can also join us on Discord to share your thoughts with our ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-15T17:55:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1796631172414452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-6339469370179182282","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest","summary":"As of today, the first playtest version of Gear Up Einstein! is available to the public ! Join the playtest directly through the steam pageOur goal is to create an incredibly fun and strategic roguelike autobattler that shines in co-op with friends, while still offering a robust single-player experience. We strongly suggest to group up with other players and play as team of 2 or 3.Let us know what you think!Submit feedback and bug reports directly in-game. You can also join us on Discord to shar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-09-25T18:39:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6339469370179182282","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2950410-6242640076611778847","game_id":"steam-2950410","kind":"announcement","title":"Coming soon !","summary":"Hi everyone, We have some exciting news to share! 🎉 First playable version of the game will be available soon, and we can’t wait for you to experience time-traveling once again with this new version! Follow us have exclusive access to the latest news. Thank you for your incredible support, and see you soon on the battlefield!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-09-09T16:18:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6242640076611778847","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2950410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2950410":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2950410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4465780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2950410","app_id":2950410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size"